meta {
  name: Check Prices
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{backendUrl}}/api/prices/check
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Cron-Secret: your-price-check-cron-secret
}

docs {
  Triggers the price-check sweep: refreshes every tracked (not-yet-owned)
  Steam App ID's price from CheapShark and posts a Discord alert (per
  user, to their own webhook or the server-wide DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL
  fallback) for anything newly on sale. Not gated by the shared
  authToken - unlike every other request in this collection, it's meant
  to be called on a schedule rather than by a logged-in user (see
  compose.yml's price-check-cron service, which does exactly this every
  6 hours), so it needs the X-Cron-Secret header above (matching the
  backend's PRICE_CHECK_CRON_SECRET) filled in manually instead. Returns
  {"alerts_sent": <count>}; 401 if the header is missing/wrong or the
  backend has no PRICE_CHECK_CRON_SECRET configured.
}
